 "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499297336_1398957598042295_8658273739049393698_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zp54pRllO10Q7kNvwHlMQdB&_nc_oc=AdpsLoFax240zJu33d9MNRU4POEM3LwUCAk8KD3xE3soQdtceyx3vVB_80Us45y6Rl4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ7_-HaofoV2lJ-Xdq1URDPKS7N8sgkQGNmBL_KECD2Xw&oe=6B04626A"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShots-Oculus.png", "id": "586954080949358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300998_586954084282691_5915317232262222336_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sY9rmkEBUkMQ7kNvwGlFxZa&_nc_oc=AdrMvoQKyTGhUWqEUVMSv8mw-BUTeYvbYTMmqCWlbwnFgnu41PXxq8Uxs6LZYSLPYW0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWBV1kL2prdmgVoq65FGgVeGDT8E3Avi-eaZWhxkrVbw&oe=6B047EA8"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShots-Oculus_05_2560x1440.png", "id": "721637487343617", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303666_721637490676950_560727177409300794_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SGbmIrP_arAQ7kNvwFXgHri&_nc_oc=Ado2dhSHCaDwvaT4yN2502Vo_IqDm-aomRcaZwMiJ19NDLWe2NM7q_JDwEQnuL-LJIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxwn3N2sPxlcmzpWsg_Si5j_jKQ1BdYolciKXbRF2HCg&oe=6B047313"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoCoverImageIAIRoulette.png", "id": "742679311697699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626133_742679315031032_2747559378173517706_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OZnz0WYiSZUQ7kNvwF8vOn4&_nc_oc=AdodSpaOIrgXKhFLqdeQ4Ol_4ejzd31bGIytnE4f7P5wYFMN-p-QhUeqmYCg1iL97jg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ6yf0t9gjAUWy8XQqqR8B4qzOJ0qosyQcZA2KMVgN-UQ&oe=6B0473D8"}, "display_name": "IAI - FreeEdition", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the beginning of I AI, a VR-only multiplayer puzzle game for two players. This version includes early game sections, introducing core mechanics, story, and cooperative gameplay\u2014plus the fully playable and replayable I AI Roulette mini-game.\n\nTo continue the story and access the full experience, purchase the full version. For the full version, please follow this link: https://www.meta.com/experiences/iai/24036573459287812/\n \n# IAI - ROULETTE\nEnjoy the different game modes! Take on the challenge against other players.\n\nTrailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zBUWUlrnlPg\n{1098247502503809}\n\n\n# MULTIPLAYER ONLY\nA cooperative experience built around two players\u2014where communication isn\u2019t optional, it\u2019s essential.\n{723622620299839}\n \n  \n# COOP PUZZLE DESIGN\nEach player experiences the world differently. No single perspective is enough to solve the game\u2019s challenges.\n{30752864537661937}\n \n \n# CROSS PLATFORM\nPlay together across PC VR and Meta Quest headsets.\n{1074700744256507}\n \n \n# NARRATIVE DRIVEN\nDiscover the story of the Dreamers through fragments of dialogue, environmental storytelling, and shared decisions.\n{1302372631527111}\n   \n  \n# FULL BODY EXPERIENCE\nSee your entire body\u2014not just your hands\u2014in VR, deepening the sense of presence and expression.\n{1810818042838837}\n", "short_description": "This version of I AI includes the first few sections of the full game, offering a complete introduction to the core mechanics, story, and cooperative gameplay.\nIt also contains the fully playable I AI Roulette mini game, designed for replayability and fun with your partner.\nTo continue the story, access later stages, and unlock the full experience, please purchase the full version of I AI. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://iai.sola-air.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sola K.K.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://iai.sola-air.com/",